rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Corrected translations in topic templates <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier-lts/pull/289\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#289</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">ACP: Changed extensions sorting <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier-lts/pull/288\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#288</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Fix $mail_to format (Adding missing &quot;&gt;&quot; at end) <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier-lts/pull/284\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#284</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>, dchistyakov)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added missing EXCLUDED_USERS_CSV in tr_stats.php <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier-lts/pull/283\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#283</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added support 7z archives <a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier-lts/pull/282\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#282</a> (<a href=\"https://github.com/belomaxorka\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">belomaxorka</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added support bmp images in BBCode <a href=\"https